    {
      "id": "calculus",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "calculation",
      "stem": "实函数f(x)=√(1+x²)。说明定义域、求导数与积分∫₀¹x/√(1+x²) dx。\n另对实参数曲线r(t)=(t,t²)求速度矢量。",
      "source": {
        "kind": "synthetic",
        "complete": true,
        "description": "本项目原创脱敏演示题；不是实际平台题目、教材摘录或学生作答。"
      },
      "solution": {
        "final": {
          "tex": "D_f=\\mathbb R,\\quad f'(x)=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}},\\quad I=\\sqrt2-1,\\quad\\vec v(t)=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2t\\end{pmatrix},\\ t\\in\\mathbb R"
        },
        "steps": [
          {
            "text": "1+x²始终大于零，根式与分母均有定义，故定义域为全体实数。"
          },
          {
            "tex": "\\begin{aligned}f'(x)&=\\frac{2x}{2\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\\\I&=\\int_0^1\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}\\,dx=\\left[\\sqrt{1+x^2}\\right]_0^1=\\sqrt2-1\\end{aligned}"
          },
          {
            "tex": "\\vec v(t)=\\frac{d\\vec r}{dt}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac{d}{dt}t\\\\\\frac{d}{dt}t^2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2t\\end{pmatrix}"
          }
        ]
      },
