        "method": "SymPy独立求导和精确积分与书面链式法则结果一致；两坐标分别求导；检查1+x²≥1排除分母零点。",
        "checks": {
          "conditions": true,
          "answer": true,
          "symbols": true,
          "units": true,
          "language": true
        }
      },
      "delivery": "image"
